// Info
Instead of relying solely on their own kind, the player decides to forge an alliance with the satyr by betraying their own people, the orcs.
They undertake missions to sabotage orcish efforts, disrupt supply lines, and weaken orcish strongholds, earning the trust and friendship of the satyr in the process.
As the player proves their loyalty to the satyr cause, they pave the way for peace negotiations, demonstrating their commitment to forging a new path of cooperation between the two factions.

